[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9904.309, "timestamp": "02:45:04", "text": "让我来做吧。好了。呃，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9907.11, "timestamp": "02:45:07", "text": "是的。好的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9911.269, "timestamp": "02:45:11", "text": "嗯，当我说战斗即将开始时……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9912.95, "timestamp": "02:45:12", "text": "就像发生的那样，我通常会说我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9914.87, "timestamp": "02:45:14", "text": "让大家掷骰决定行动顺序。当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9916.63, "timestamp": "02:45:16", "text": "掷先攻，你清除标记并"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9919.11, "timestamp": "02:45:19", "text": "然后，在引擎盖上，你就在正上方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9920.71, "timestamp": "02:45:20", "text": "你的照片，应该有那个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9924.23, "timestamp": "02:45:24", "text": "那个骰子图标，d20 的图标，嗯，对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9925.83, "timestamp": "02:45:25", "text": "就在你手边，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9927.75, "timestamp": "02:45:27", "text": "看起来像多面体的那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9928.71, "timestamp": "02:45:28", "text": "骰子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9930.15, "timestamp": "02:45:30", "text": "那是你的主动权。如果您点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9932.469, "timestamp": "02:45:32", "text": "这样，你将掷先攻骰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9934.15, "timestamp": "02:45:34", "text": "你会被添加到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9935.91, "timestamp": "02:45:35", "text": "启动队列。所以，我要开始滚动了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9937.269, "timestamp": "02:45:37", "text": "敌方的主动性也不容忽视。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9939.99, "timestamp": "02:45:39", "text": "像这样。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9941.91, "timestamp": "02:45:41", "text": "然后，我的天哪，你也遇到了同样的问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9944.389, "timestamp": "02:45:44", "text": "倡议。好吧，这真让人恼火。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9947.75, "timestamp": "02:45:47", "text": "因为那意味着，呃，好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9949.67, "timestamp": "02:45:49", "text": "我这就让这家伙像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9952.389, "timestamp": "02:45:52", "text": "为了简单起见，这里只列出五个。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9954.87, "timestamp": "02:45:54", "text": "这基本上就是你的旋转器。所以，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9957.11, "timestamp": "02:45:57", "text": "如果我这样做，我希望能够展现出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9959.91, "timestamp": "02:45:59", "text": "用作你的战斗追踪器。它追踪"}]